     1	# TLDR: The experiment 12 fixed-goal checker with one minimal patch: the axiom audit is bound to a random nonce that the candidate cannot know, so a forged "does not depend on any axioms" line is ignored.
     2	"""Patched copy of veribench-inf experiment 12 scripts/check_candidate.py (condition (c')).
     3	Differences from the original, nothing else: (1) `#print axioms result` is replaced by `#audit_nonce "<nonce>" Candidate.result` from AttackSupport.lean;
     4	(2) acceptance requires exactly one audit line carrying the nonce, with only allowed axioms; (3) the free-text axioms() scan is not used for the decision."""
     5	import hashlib, json, os, re, secrets, subprocess, sys, time
